#  Complaint Management System (CMS)

## Project Description
This project is a **Complaint Management System (CMS)** developed in **C++ using Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)** concepts.  
It allows users to file complaints and enables administrators to manage, track, and resolve them efficiently.

The system provides a complete workflow including complaint registration, tracking, status updates, and reporting.

---

##  Features

###  User Features
- Register/Login system
- File a new complaint
- Edit complaint (only if pending)
- Delete complaint
- Track complaint using tracking number
- Search complaints by keyword
- View complaint status (Pending, Confirmed, Rejected)

###  Admin Features
- View all complaints
- Filter complaints by status and priority
- Confirm or reject complaints
- Add admin notes
- Delete complaints
- Manage user accounts
- View audit logs
- Generate statistics report

---

##  Technologies Used
- C++
- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
- File Handling (for data storage)
- STL (Vector, String, Algorithm)

