##  How to Run

1. Open the project in any C++ IDE (e.g., Dev C++, CodeBlocks, Visual Studio)
2. Compile the program
3. Run the executable file

---

##  System Roles

###  User
- Can file and manage their own complaints

###  Admin
- Can manage all complaints and users

---

##  System Functionalities
- Complaint Tracking System (Tracking ID like CMS-0001)
- Status Management (Pending, Confirmed, Rejected)
- Priority Levels (Low, Medium, High)
- Category Selection (Theft, Fraud, Harassment, etc.)
- Audit Logging for system actions

